# copperline

[![make.fun · gta6-01](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-01)
[![rank](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01/cwybruce/copperline/rank.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01/leaderboard?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-01)
[![reward](https://make.fun/badge/gta6-01/cwybruce/copperline/reward.svg)](https://make.fun/bounty/gta6-01?utm_source=github&utm_medium=readme&utm_campaign=gta6-01)

Copperline is an underground subway heist in the Port Vane Metro: you are the fixer, running four jobs before the line shuts down at 02:47 — lift a manifest off a courier, steal a Copper Line train, outrun transit police through the tunnels, and vanish at the surface gate.

## Run it

```sh
node serve.ts
```

Then open http://localhost:8080 in your browser.

